    "summary": "When the Reave-Captain’s unit [declares a charge](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step), look for enemy units in range of [an objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives) and no farther than 12″ from the charging unit. If you find any, you may invoke Raider’s Due and choose whether to reroll the dice for that charge. Any [charge move](vsdata:core-rule/charge-move) the unit then makes must finish [engaged](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) with at least one eligible enemy.",
